WEBVTT

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.840
I have met countless patients and carried out countless operations.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:33.510
Every one of those patients sinks into my memories as a single page of a medical chart.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.050
However, from time to time...

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:45.560
Is that you, Pinoko? You snuck a cellphone into my bag again?

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:48.690
What's wrong?!

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:51.270
Doctor.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.320
Help me.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:00:59.120
Pinoko?!

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.430
Lady Yurie!

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.690
Lady Yurie!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.040
Pinoko!

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:53.710
Karte 11 - Visited Memories

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:22.320
Utagau hodo ni shinjiru mae ni sono mae ni
As much as you doubt it, before you believe it, even before that...

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:31.460
Ushinau hodo ni motomeru mae ni sayonara wo
As much as you would lose it, before you seek it, bid it farewell.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:40.680
Kono mama zutto egao wo mitsumete itai dake sa
I just want to see you smile like this forever.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:50.560
Kioku to iu ryouude ni kimi wo daite
 Holding you in these arms called memories.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.810
Tabidachi wa ima shikkoku no toki
We set out now, when it is darkest.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.610
Haruka no yami no mukou ni
 To go to a place beyond the darkness.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:03.740
Mada kyou wa naku mashite kinou ni wa tooku
We're not there yet today but it was even more distant yesterday.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:09.660
Darkest time just before the sunrise.
Darkest time just before the sunrise.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:18.050
Hito ni namae wo tazuneraretara tabibito to
When people ask your name, call yourself a traveler.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:26.970
Tatta sore dake kotaete hoshii sore dake wo
That's all I want you to answer. Just that.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:36.150
Yukue mo tsugezu wakare no kotoba mo nokosanaide
Tell no one where you're going and leave no farewells.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:46.200
Dokoka he kiete shimatta dake no hito to
Be someone who simply wandered off somewhere and disappeared.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:54.290
Samishiku wa nai shitteiru kara saigo wa itsumo hitori to
It's not lonely because, you know, in the end you're always alone.

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.170
Dakara kokoro wo tojite koko ni tadoritsuku
So close your heart and reach this place.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:05.090
Darkest time just before the sunrise.
Darkest time just before the sunrise.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:12.810
Tabidachi wa ima shikkoku no toki
We set out now, when it is darkest.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:17.150
Haruka no yami no mukou ni
 To go to a place beyond the darkness.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:25.950
Samishiku wa nai shitteiru kara saigo wa itsumo hitori to
It's not lonely because, you know, in the end you're always alone.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:30.410
Tabidachi wa ima shikkoku no toki
We set out now, when it is darkest.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:34.870
Haruka no yami no mukou ni
 To go to a place beyond the darkness.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:48.890
Even after carrying out an examination at a hospital with all the newest equipment, I couldn't find any abnormality in Pinoko's body.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:10.070
At 16:45 Pinoko's condition settled.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.240
She fell asleep as though nothing had happened.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:19.580
However, even if the test showed no abnormalities, the spasms that attacked Pinoko's body were real.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:24.510
Those spasms closely resembled those of a patient suffering a heart attack.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.930
Doctor! Your patient is...!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:33.220
I keep telling you there's nothing wrong with me!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.140
Call my Doctor! Doctor!!

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.230
I'm hungry...

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.530
Saionji General Hospital

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.080
This is...!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.630
Honestly! I was so hungry!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:13.140
Though, if it means you'll treat me to a dinner like this then maybe getting sick once in a while isn't so bad.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.180
Is there really nothing wrong with you now?

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:21.270
Suddenly my heart started beating really fast, but I'm perfectly fine now!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:24.980
Who are you?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.940
Is someone there...?

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.320
Sister...

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.740
Sister...

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:38.040
You are...!

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:39.910
Why...?

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.210
Sister...

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.960
Wait!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:52.800
Takao...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.930
Yes... Lady Yurie...

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.600
The dance...

00:06:59.230 --> 00:06:59.850
Huh?

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.440
Takao... Bring the flute!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.440
I'm going to practice!

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:11.950
I will practice the dance!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.280
L-Lady Yurie...!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.200
This is pointless... No one can cure me.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:24.420
8:05, Pinoko was struck by another unexplained spasm attack.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.670
Doctor...

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:31.930
Work hard...

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:36.470
You have work... I'll make you some coffee...

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.350
This is a sedative. It will help you settle down.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.690
I have to discover the cause of these spasms.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:49.280
This was the fifth attack. The symptoms were all the same.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:55.280
And, no matter how much I analyzed the results of her examination, I couldn't find a single medical irregularity anywhere.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:02.750
Pinoko... What on Earth is happening inside your body?

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:17.550
That's right, the night I first met Pinoko... it was a cold rainy night like this.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.830
It has been ten years since then.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.750
Could you keep it down?

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.010
I have a patient sleeping.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.010
I've called you over and over.

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.050
There... There's a patient only you can save, Doctor!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.640
Go away.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.100
I can't take any jobs at the moment.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:08.270
Doctor, you're the only one! The only one who can save Lady Yurie!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:13.280
Just like you saved her from that teratoid cystoma ten years ago!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.070
They won't go away! The tumors won't go away!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:26.040
We cut them off again and again but more tumors keep developing all over her body!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.130
Please! I'm begging you, help us!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.210
I must return to Lady Yurie's side.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.590
Doctor, we will be waiting for you.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.050
Teratoid cystoma?

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.730
She was a patient I would never be able to forget.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:49.690
Medical Chart #427...

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.030
Please... Throw it away.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.240
Three days later, I took Pinoko and went to see that patient.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.750
I hadn't accepted this job simply because I had been moved by Takao's words.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:14.130
The medical charts Takao brought with him showed the precise times of a series of spasms.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:18.260
And... There was one fact there that I had to pay attention to.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.680
However, what gave me the final push was...

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.270
Pinoko, what's the matter?

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.600
Please... Save her...

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:32.610
Huh?

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.650
My big sister... Please, save her...

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.160
When Pinoko said that to me.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.670
It says West... Garden.. Temple... There and there too.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.580
Why are they all West Garden Temple?

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.420
It's read "Saionji."

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.170
This is the area where the Saionji style began.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.010
Saionji...

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:06.810
Having one hundred thousand members nationally, they are the largest school of dance in the country.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:13.150
Further, they are also the center of the Saionji Group which owns banks, hospitals and businesses.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:18.480
They are said to hold great power in both the financial and political worlds.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:23.450
This hotel district is called Saionji Village.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:25.740
Things are quiet here now.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:30.370
But when the Shikinensai Festival comes around it's overflowing with people and quite lively.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.000
That is the main hall and dormatory of the Saionji School of Dance.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.800
This area we're in is already Saionji land.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:46.140
Dr. Black Jack...

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.520
I'm so glad. I'm so glad you've come.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:53.770
Wow, you're a cutie. I'm Pinoko.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:56.520
May I see the patient?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.320
Also, could you take care of this girl while I perform the examination?

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:00.480
What?!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.030
I do believe you promised.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:05.450
First, listen to everything the doctor tells me!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:08.160
Second, don't go wandering off on my own!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:11.790
Third, don't meet the patient!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:12.910
That's what it was.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.960
All right then, take Pinoko to the parlour.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:18.590
Understood.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:25.010
Looking at her medical chart the patient should have been in no condition to leave the hospital.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.180
Yes...

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.310
She is in here.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:37.730
Welcome, and thank you for coming, Dr. Black Jack.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:44.530
I am the head of the main branch of the Saionji family, Saionji Yurie.

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.620
Ah! I'm so bored!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.120
Just for a little while...

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:01.840
I don't know what Takao has told you, but I have one condition before you take this job.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:06.180
I have no intention of asking you to save my life.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.600
In two months, there is the Shikinensai Festival.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.270
You need only make it so that I can dance there.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.020
Lady Yurie!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.440
I desire nothing further.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:21.320
Will you take this job, Dr. Black Jack?

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.900
One hundred million.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.410
My price will be one hundred million yen.

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:29.950
You should be able to handle that.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.740
Very well.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:34.950
Then I will ask you to handle this.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.120
Now then, Takao.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:37.870
Yes?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.170
It's time. Get ready.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:55.020
Oh, wow! What a huge mansion!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:57.270
Huh?

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:26.630
Sister...

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.180
Sister...

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:35.930
Fly. Become the white heron.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:37.270
Fly.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.240
Pinoko!

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:52.990
Doctor!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.000
Is she always doing that sort of practice?

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.250
Yes.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:09.050
Looking at the patient's condition, you should know that that's downright suicidal.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:13.010
This is all so that she can dance The Ascent of the White Heron.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:18.100
At the Shikinensai Festival which is run by the Saionji Family...

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:26.110
Said to bring peace to the world, It is an important ceremony carried out once every ten years inviting many important people.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.150
For the rite danced by the Saionji family head there...

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.950
So that she can dance The Ascent of the White Heron.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:36.240
Everything is in preparation for that day.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.330
And what are you going to do if she can't dance?

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:41.960
Not yet...

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.630
The White Heron can't fly yet.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:53.630
Dr. Black Jack, you need only make it so that I can dance.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:58.850
So that I can dance The Ascent of the White Heron...

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.650
I've prepared a room for you, Doctor.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.400
I'm sorry, but could I get a ride back to the village?

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.780
I'll look for an inn there.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:20.330
It looks like I wasn't wrong in what I was thinking.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:24.580
It's clear that Saionji Yurie and Pinoko's spasms are occuring at the same time.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.170
The time from onset to cessation.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:31.420
The common values in heart rate and blood pressure.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.840
Medically, it's a ridiculous theory but...

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.510
Now, I am certain.

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:40.260
Why? Because these two were once the same person!

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:53.320
Yes, it was a night with heavy rain like this.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:59.160
To be precise, it was my first encounter with both Yurie and Pinoko.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:06.330
There's nothing else we can do but rely on you, Dr. Black Jack.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:07.920
Even if you are unlicensed.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.420
I've heard you are highly skilled.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:16.180
Countless doctors have run away from me, unable to do anything.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.390
What about you, Doctor?

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:23.180
Can you remove the object inside me.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:27.190
As long as you have the money.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.980
Then it's a promise.

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:37.780
Please, remove this awful cyst.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.410
Teratoid cystoma.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:53.960
Sometimes, what should have been born as twins is instead born with only part of one fetus imbedded in the body of the other.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:18:00.050
But, in the case of this patient's cyst all of the organs necessary for a human were present.

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:05.640
Further, this cyst possessed a power which had kept many doctors away.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:09.190
What?!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.810
Don't cut me!

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.150
Don't cut me!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.940
Don't cut me!!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.950
Suddenly, some sort of power began to violently resist me.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.210
Don't cut me!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:31.830
Don't cut me!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:37.300
I see, you don't want me to cut you.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.220
Is that it? Is that right?

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:44.970
If you have the will to live...

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.680
I will keep you alive!

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.800
The operation was a success.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.060
Was it?

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:33.190
Do you want to meet the one I cut out of you who should have been your little sister?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.530
Please, throw it away.

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:46.240
As midnight approached, the rain turned to snow.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:53.120
I pulled out the parts stored in bio-fluid and connected them one by one.

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:18.940
And so, a new life was born.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:29.200
Leaving Pinoko at the inn, I departed to examine Saionji Yurie.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:34.790
On the grounds, there was already an operating room with the latest equipment.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:40.670
Also, though it was limited, a research room had been prepared as well.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.720
To think I would meet you again...

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.720
If you find anything lacking, please contact me.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.390
I work at the hospital so ask me for anything.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:21:02.690
Analyzing the patient's data, after operating to remove a malignant tumour a new one appeared elsewhere three days later.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.280
Many world famous doctors have operated on her.

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:10.410
It happened even though the operations had been carried out nearly perfectly.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.960
It was analyzed from an oncological and immunological perspective.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:24.470
Though many different approaches were tried no hint as to the cause could be found.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.180
Look! You got killed!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:37.480
Even now, new tumours are developing at an alarming rate.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:42.150
What is going on inside this patient's body?

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.110
I must discover that as soon as possible.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:54.200
What's the matter? Are you not feeling well?

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:57.370
Bored! Bored! Bored! That's what I am!

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:59.960
Have you forgotten our promise?

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:04.760
But! But! You're always out working so late!

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:07.720
There's nothing for Pinoko to do!

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:10.800
We're like a husband and wife who've gotten tired of each other!

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.180
Want to go for a walk once you're finished eating?

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.970
Yeah! Let's do that!

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:19.600
I thought this might happen so I borrowed a car from the old man at the inn.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:22.440
So he told me... Oh, turn to the right here!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:28.150
So, there's a stone path in the woods, and...

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:32.030
If you follow it all the way...

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:41.080
This place seems kind of...

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:53.970
I wonder why.

00:22:57.100 --> 00:23:00.310
It feels so... familiar...

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:33.590
I-It's a ghost! Ahh!

00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:34.800
How rude!

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:39.310
I'm no ghost! I'm Matsunojou the oyama!

00:23:39.520 --> 00:23:40.640
You're gay?

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:42.900
An oyama!

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:45.690
It's a male actor who plays female roles!

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:47.400
You two sightseers?

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:51.490
Hate to tell you this but since the ceremony is getting close visitors aren't allowed.

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:53.950
Uh oh!

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:58.330
It's good to see worshipers come out on such a cold day.

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:01.330
Would you like to come in for a cup of sweet sake?

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:05.460
The gentleman gathering vegetables who is now hiding behind you is welcome to come in as well.

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:14.930
This White Heron Temple has had strong ties with the Saionji family since long ago.

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:18.600
You saw the dance stage out on the lake.

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:24.600
That is where the head of the Saionji School of Dance will dance during the upcoming ceremony.

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:27.150
Please, look at this.

00:24:28.190 --> 00:24:34.030
There is a legend that a heavenly maiden who had taken the form of a white heron descended on this land.

00:24:34.030 --> 00:24:39.450
That's right! The heavenly maiden got together with a human and twins were born, but...!

00:24:39.450 --> 00:24:43.410
They say one of the twins was slain by humans and she was unable to return to the heavens.

00:24:44.120 --> 00:24:47.920
To bring together the heavenly maiden and the soul of her dead baby and return them to heaven!

00:24:47.920 --> 00:24:51.920
That is the ceremony, The Rite of the Ascent of the White Heron.

00:24:52.880 --> 00:24:55.590
But there's another story here, you see...

00:24:55.590 --> 00:24:59.470
Due to the curse of the dead child, should twins be born to the Saionji family one will never grow up.

00:24:59.470 --> 00:25:00.260
Hey!

00:25:02.140 --> 00:25:07.190
Wow! You were that preist's son, Matsunojou?!

00:25:07.190 --> 00:25:10.610
That's right! He practically disinherited me when I ran away from the temple.

00:25:10.900 --> 00:25:13.400
My luck ran out when I decided to become an actor...

00:25:13.400 --> 00:25:15.400
I went around around never gathering much attention.

00:25:15.400 --> 00:25:16.910
Oh, there it is. Right there.

00:25:16.910 --> 00:25:20.410
Snack Matsunojou

00:25:17.410 --> 00:25:20.410
Now, I've come back to my hometown and am working as a mama at a snack bar.

00:25:21.030 --> 00:25:23.000
Thanks for the ride.

00:25:23.000 --> 00:25:24.410
If you feel like it drop by some time.

00:25:24.410 --> 00:25:27.420
Snack Matsunojou

00:25:24.910 --> 00:25:27.420
I'll give you lots of free service!

00:25:27.710 --> 00:25:29.500
See you later!

00:25:29.750 --> 00:25:31.710
Saionji twins...

00:25:33.590 --> 00:25:35.760
They say the family head is sick.

00:25:35.760 --> 00:25:38.430
Yeah, the rumors say it's pretty bad.

00:25:39.340 --> 00:25:40.760
Okay, that's it.

00:25:41.180 --> 00:25:43.470
Now let's have the receivers go first.

00:25:43.810 --> 00:25:46.890
Then the new head will be Lady Midori.

00:25:46.890 --> 00:25:50.860
Yes, she is an incredible dancer and Yurie's equal.

00:25:50.980 --> 00:25:53.980
And Midori's father is Lord Tachibana.

00:25:53.980 --> 00:25:56.950
It seems he's scheming various things in the background.

00:25:56.950 --> 00:25:58.030
Oh, my...

00:25:58.820 --> 00:26:00.120
Pardon me.

00:26:03.330 --> 00:26:06.120
Were you unable to eat again?

00:26:06.660 --> 00:26:09.120
How was today's practice?

00:26:09.120 --> 00:26:12.210
Lady Midori carried out things without a hitch.

00:26:13.170 --> 00:26:14.000
I see...

00:26:14.760 --> 00:26:16.550
Then it's about time.

00:26:17.220 --> 00:26:18.130
Lady Yurie...!

00:26:18.130 --> 00:26:20.470
I'll wear the chrysanthemum kimono.

00:26:21.430 --> 00:26:24.100
Ready my ceremonial kimono.

00:26:27.310 --> 00:26:30.900
Lady Midori has been handling so much lately.

00:26:31.190 --> 00:26:33.820
You must be so proud of her, Lord Tachibana.

00:26:42.030 --> 00:26:45.330
Sorry to keep you waiting. Let us begin the meeting now.

00:26:49.160 --> 00:26:51.000
The subject of today's discussion is...

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:51.920
Hold on a moment.

00:26:52.380 --> 00:26:57.420
Before we begin the meeting I have something I wish to ask of the family head.

00:26:58.050 --> 00:27:02.260
It may be rude of me to say this, but your health does not seem to be well of late.

00:27:03.180 --> 00:27:08.480
I hear rumours of you letting a strange doctor into the mansion to treat you.

00:27:09.350 --> 00:27:15.190
Can you dance The Ritual Ascent of the White Heron in that state, I wonder?

00:27:17.320 --> 00:27:20.240
How can you say that?! Your reckless remarks offend the family head!

00:27:20.240 --> 00:27:22.200
No, I will say it.

00:27:23.280 --> 00:27:31.210
As you know, the Saionji School recieves special treatment from the government for performing The Ascent of the White Heron.

00:27:31.790 --> 00:27:36.340
That is how we've gathered many supporters in the financial and political worlds.

00:27:37.050 --> 00:27:42.720
If the ritual were to be canceled the Saionji family would lose its influence!

00:27:47.060 --> 00:27:49.680
Then what do you want us to do, Tachibana?

00:27:50.060 --> 00:27:54.480
Now, now. Thinking about that is our responsibility as directors.

00:27:54.980 --> 00:27:56.270
I understand.

00:27:57.980 --> 00:28:04.200
To prepare for the worst case scenario, I will hand down The Ascent of the White Heron to Midori.

00:28:05.240 --> 00:28:08.290
You'll pass that dance which is only handed down from parent to child to my Midori?

00:28:08.870 --> 00:28:13.790
B-But, its a tradition that The Ascent of the White Heron must be preformed by the Saionji family head!

00:28:13.790 --> 00:28:15.330
I realize that.

00:28:16.170 --> 00:28:21.300
Should the time come that I am unable to dance The Ascent of the White Heron, I will step down as family head.

00:28:23.090 --> 00:28:24.840
Call Midori here.

00:28:24.840 --> 00:28:26.850
I will begin her training now.

00:28:29.430 --> 00:28:33.690
Midori, I will now hand down The Ascent of the White Heron to you.

00:28:34.560 --> 00:28:37.400
I will show you the dance now.

00:28:37.400 --> 00:28:40.280
Burn this scene into your memory.

00:28:41.070 --> 00:28:43.530
Yes, I will humbly watch.

00:28:45.700 --> 00:28:47.780
Takao, play the flute.

00:28:47.780 --> 00:28:48.490
Yes Ma'am.

00:29:45.510 --> 00:29:48.050
This is the dance, The Ascent of the White Heron

00:29:49.760 --> 00:29:51.390
Devote yourself to it.

00:29:59.980 --> 00:30:02.520
So, she only meant to show us her strength...

00:30:07.030 --> 00:30:09.780
Why must you push yourself so hard?

00:30:10.320 --> 00:30:12.030
You don't understand.

00:30:12.030 --> 00:30:13.410
The Ascent of the White Heron...

00:30:14.910 --> 00:30:16.200
I...

00:30:35.140 --> 00:30:36.770
Are you there?

00:30:36.770 --> 00:30:38.770
Yes, I'm right here.

00:30:41.350 --> 00:30:44.110
Right here. I am here.

00:30:44.820 --> 00:30:48.150
Stay there. Always stay with me.

00:30:49.780 --> 00:30:51.530
You haven't eaten in days.

00:30:52.660 --> 00:30:56.620
I've given you a calorie transfusion but the drop in physical strength is harsh.

00:30:56.870 --> 00:31:02.130
At this rate, not only will you not be able to dance, you'll die of malnutrition.

00:31:02.710 --> 00:31:05.300
Is your position as family head worth more than your life?

00:31:06.880 --> 00:31:08.090
Will I...

00:31:09.050 --> 00:31:13.640
Will I be able to dance The Ascent of the White Heron?

00:31:16.180 --> 00:31:20.020
Well?! Dr. Black Jack?! Answer me!

00:31:20.690 --> 00:31:24.270
I have to return the White Heron to the heavens! I promised!

00:31:24.690 --> 00:31:29.280
It will set us free from the curse of the twins!

00:31:31.280 --> 00:31:33.570
Certainly, the family head's dancing was impressive.

00:31:34.280 --> 00:31:37.990
However, Midori, you too bear the blood of a Saionji.

00:31:38.910 --> 00:31:42.120
You will definitely dance The Ascent of the White Heron.

00:31:50.090 --> 00:31:51.130
Go ahead.

00:31:53.300 --> 00:31:58.390
This is the Saionji family tree which has been recorded back as far as the Heian Period.

00:31:58.970 --> 00:31:59.970
This is...!

00:32:03.940 --> 00:32:06.610
The legend of the twins I told you before?

00:32:07.900 --> 00:32:12.490
I'm pretty sure I've heard there's some old documents on it in the shrine, but...

00:32:12.990 --> 00:32:16.370
Well... Until the ceremony is over you won't be able to get into the temple.

00:32:13.780 --> 00:32:17.530
<i>You can't win me over with freedom!</i>

00:32:17.530 --> 00:32:21.790
<i>Oh! My heart is dangerous!</i>

00:32:21.790 --> 00:32:25.750
<i>Everything is always so tedious and boring!</i>

00:32:25.710 --> 00:32:28.840
Well, I do owe you one.

00:32:25.750 --> 00:32:30.000
<i>It's a wonder that I'm still alive!</i>

00:32:32.010 --> 00:32:36.510
I was practically disinherited when I ran away from this place so I'd rather not run into my dad, you know?

00:32:36.510 --> 00:32:40.720
Still, sometimes I come out here to do things like gather vegetables to serve in the shop.

00:32:40.720 --> 00:32:42.020
It's this way.

00:32:43.020 --> 00:32:45.650
That right there. That's the main shrine.

00:32:45.650 --> 00:32:47.520
But can we get in?

00:32:48.360 --> 00:32:50.980
You see, there's a way we can sneak in.

00:32:50.980 --> 00:32:51.990
You damn fool!

00:32:52.280 --> 00:32:54.650
D-Dad?!

00:32:54.950 --> 00:32:56.610
You're incorrigible!

00:32:58.410 --> 00:33:02.580
I see, so you are Lady Yurie's doctor?

00:33:03.250 --> 00:33:06.000
Go ahead, please, enter.

00:33:06.710 --> 00:33:09.670
This is the main shrine where the ceremony will take place.

00:33:09.920 --> 00:33:12.920
If this will be of help to Lady Yurie...

00:33:13.670 --> 00:33:16.760
Could this be the document you are looking for?

00:33:18.300 --> 00:33:20.720
It is an old document on the ancestors of the Saionji family.

00:33:22.810 --> 00:33:26.020
You should understand its link to the legend of the White Heron.

00:33:27.190 --> 00:33:32.150
The Saionji family's history begins with a princess born of noble blood.

00:33:37.740 --> 00:33:41.910
That princess was caught up in a struggle between warriors.

00:33:41.910 --> 00:33:45.830
She was chased from the capital and fled to this distant land to save her life.

00:33:46.410 --> 00:33:49.500
She arrived at this temple far from civilization.

00:33:51.210 --> 00:33:54.880
The divine maiden who descended from the heavens in the form of a white heron.

00:33:56.090 --> 00:34:01.050
Surely, that represents one of high status who came from the capital.

00:34:02.010 --> 00:34:06.600
With time, she was joined with one of her companions and became pregnant.

00:34:06.980 --> 00:34:11.060
However, she was unfortunately found by her pursuers and her companion was slain.

00:34:11.060 --> 00:34:14.480
The princess was spared the death penalty due to her high stature, but...

00:34:14.860 --> 00:34:21.240
To prevent any later problems it was ordered that her child be slain on birth.

00:34:21.410 --> 00:34:25.660
However, fortunately or unfortunately, the princess gave birth to twins...

00:34:25.910 --> 00:34:28.500
In those days, the birth of twins was rare.

00:34:28.830 --> 00:34:33.170
She was granted the mercy of being allowed to keep one child if she offered up the other.

00:34:33.500 --> 00:34:37.970
The princess was faced with the cruel choice of deciding which baby was to die.

00:34:39.430 --> 00:34:41.510
The princess chose a child.

00:34:41.510 --> 00:34:48.560
However, that choice came in the form of casting herself into the lake along with her child.

00:34:49.390 --> 00:34:53.980
The surviving child became the ancestor of the Saionji family.

00:34:55.480 --> 00:35:02.620
Ever since, whenever twins are born to the Saionji family, one is always taken away to the heavens within five years.

00:35:02.620 --> 00:35:05.700
They came to believe in the curse of the twins.

00:35:06.370 --> 00:35:14.210
The ceremony, The Ascent of the White Heron, is a prayer rite to break the curse of the twins for the Saionji family.

00:35:14.960 --> 00:35:16.710
Doctor!

00:35:17.420 --> 00:35:18.420
A curse?

00:35:19.420 --> 00:35:22.340
Twins carrying the destiny that only one could live.

00:35:22.760 --> 00:35:25.510
The destiny that the Saionji family can not escape.

00:35:26.350 --> 00:35:28.430
I've no interest in curses, but...

00:35:31.850 --> 00:35:35.190
Rarely, there are families where twins are born often.

00:35:35.820 --> 00:35:37.610
The Saionji family is one of them.

00:35:38.900 --> 00:35:44.280
And, without exception, one of the twins always dies within a few years.

00:35:45.240 --> 00:35:48.750
Yurie and Pinoko were originally meant to born as twins.

00:35:49.250 --> 00:35:53.960
But what if Pinoko was able to escape from that fate by being born as a teratoid cystoma?

00:35:55.670 --> 00:35:57.460
That's right, there has to be a reason.

00:35:57.920 --> 00:35:59.920
A reason why only one of the twins dies.

00:36:00.590 --> 00:36:04.180
And that should give me some clue on how to treat the patient.

00:36:13.020 --> 00:36:14.560
Takao, play the flute.

00:36:14.850 --> 00:36:15.980
Y-Yes Ma'am!

00:36:17.480 --> 00:36:20.280
Yurie's condition worsens by the day.

00:36:21.530 --> 00:36:23.740
And, even the practice which she would never skip...

00:36:26.990 --> 00:36:27.990
Lady Yurie!

00:36:29.740 --> 00:36:32.500
...was rendered impossible by her condition.

00:37:01.320 --> 00:37:03.400
Pinoko, it doesn't look like I'll be making it back tonight either.

00:37:03.400 --> 00:37:06.240
Right, right. Nothing to worry about.

00:37:06.240 --> 00:37:09.910
I'm working at Matsunojou's place as a hostess again tonight.

00:37:09.910 --> 00:37:12.450
Doctor, you just keep working hard...

00:37:15.960 --> 00:37:16.620
Pinoko?!

00:37:16.620 --> 00:37:18.880
Oh no! Pinoko! Pinoko?!

00:37:20.000 --> 00:37:20.840
Pinoko!

00:37:21.590 --> 00:37:23.970
Save my big sister...

00:37:24.590 --> 00:37:25.930
At the lake...

00:37:26.800 --> 00:37:27.680
At the lake?

00:37:34.890 --> 00:37:36.140
I am fine...

00:37:37.150 --> 00:37:38.770
I can still...

00:37:39.860 --> 00:37:41.360
Dance...

00:37:52.240 --> 00:37:53.120
Pinoko?!

00:37:53.120 --> 00:37:55.000
-Pinoko! Pinoko hang in there!
-Yes, we have an emergency case!

00:37:59.880 --> 00:38:01.590
My promise with you...

00:38:02.590 --> 00:38:04.300
To make the White Heron fly...

00:38:05.170 --> 00:38:06.920
I will return it to heaven!

00:38:12.010 --> 00:38:15.520
If I do, then surely we will be...

00:38:46.210 --> 00:38:47.720
Dr. Black Jack.

00:38:50.010 --> 00:38:51.390
I made a promise.

00:38:52.260 --> 00:38:56.350
To that girl. To that other girl inside of me.

00:38:58.020 --> 00:39:00.140
I was always all alone.

00:39:01.400 --> 00:39:03.020
Until I met that girl.

00:39:05.570 --> 00:39:06.900
Don't cry.

00:39:08.150 --> 00:39:09.200
Who're you?

00:39:09.700 --> 00:39:11.160
Don't cry.

00:39:11.740 --> 00:39:13.780
Who are you?

00:39:14.780 --> 00:39:16.160
I am me.

00:39:16.790 --> 00:39:18.120
Me?

00:39:18.120 --> 00:39:19.460
Yes, me.

00:39:25.250 --> 00:39:28.300
I went because that girl was with me.

00:39:29.260 --> 00:39:32.430
When the White Heron flies the curse will be broken?

00:39:32.890 --> 00:39:35.180
Yes! I'm sure it will be broken!

00:39:35.850 --> 00:39:39.680
Then fly. Sister, become the White Heron and fly.

00:39:40.560 --> 00:39:43.600
Yes, fly! I will fly!

00:39:44.940 --> 00:39:48.650
But, time would not wait forever...

00:39:49.440 --> 00:39:51.400
The cyst continued to grow.

00:39:52.280 --> 00:39:53.570
One day, I...

00:39:55.320 --> 00:39:57.790
We can't stay together like this.

00:39:58.660 --> 00:40:04.080
In the legend, the princess cast herself into this lake along with her baby.

00:40:07.300 --> 00:40:10.760
Come on, tell me. What should I do?

00:40:11.300 --> 00:40:13.470
I want to stay with you forever.

00:40:14.180 --> 00:40:16.350
Give me an answer! Please!

00:40:17.010 --> 00:40:21.020
Let the White Heron fly. Return it to heaven.

00:40:21.430 --> 00:40:22.520
It's a promise.

00:40:23.140 --> 00:40:25.270
Good bye, Sister.

00:40:25.940 --> 00:40:31.690
I had that girl cut off so that I could dance The Ascent of the White Heron.

00:40:33.490 --> 00:40:36.370
Please... Throw it away.

00:40:43.120 --> 00:40:48.040
She was my irreplaceable little sister. But, I...

00:40:49.840 --> 00:40:50.880
She's alive.

00:40:51.300 --> 00:40:52.050
What?

00:40:52.920 --> 00:40:54.720
That girl is alive.

00:40:54.720 --> 00:40:56.010
She's alive?

00:40:58.010 --> 00:41:00.390
She doesn't remember you.

00:41:00.770 --> 00:41:04.730
However, she asked me to save you.

00:41:06.560 --> 00:41:08.360
So you need to survive as well!

00:41:09.070 --> 00:41:10.820
Live and fulfil your promise!

00:41:11.900 --> 00:41:15.740
You and Yurie weren't in the manor so I thought, maybe...!

00:41:16.160 --> 00:41:18.240
Doctor, is Lady Yurie alright?!

00:41:18.530 --> 00:41:21.080
She has severe cyanosis. I can't feel a pulse either.

00:41:21.870 --> 00:41:24.710
Doctor, somehow, save Lady Yurie...

00:41:24.710 --> 00:41:26.750
Save Lady Yurie, please!

00:41:30.800 --> 00:41:33.710
Saturation is over 80%.

00:41:34.420 --> 00:41:37.260
Due to ventricular fibrillation we cannot take her blood pressure.

00:41:37.840 --> 00:41:40.680
Unfortunately, we can only watch for now.

00:41:40.680 --> 00:41:41.680
I'm going to operate!

00:41:41.680 --> 00:41:43.310
S-Say what?!

00:41:43.310 --> 00:41:44.770
With her like this, it's impossible!

00:41:44.770 --> 00:41:48.980
After removing all eight tumors I will carry out a transplant.

00:41:48.980 --> 00:41:53.990
Further, taking the patient's condition into consideration I will complete the procedure within 60 minutes.

00:41:54.320 --> 00:41:58.280
That's ridiculous! This is a major operation that would normally take six hours!

00:41:58.660 --> 00:42:01.450
There's no way the patient's body will hold up!

00:42:01.450 --> 00:42:04.000
Besides, what are you planning to transplant?

00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:06.120
The operation begins in 15 minutes!

00:42:06.120 --> 00:42:06.960
Hurry up!

00:42:07.670 --> 00:42:09.080
I will be head surgeon!

00:42:12.250 --> 00:42:14.170
It was a certainly dangerous gamble.

00:42:14.710 --> 00:42:19.140
Yurie's strength had already declined to the point it was unsafe to operate.

00:42:19.510 --> 00:42:26.480
Even so, it was certain that if the tumors were not removed immediately Yurie's life would be extinguished.

00:42:27.100 --> 00:42:30.900
And, at that moment, Pinoko's life would end as well.

00:42:31.610 --> 00:42:32.440
Scissors.

00:42:33.020 --> 00:42:33.820
Forceps.

00:42:34.780 --> 00:42:38.240
The curse of the twins. I had formulated a theory about it.

00:42:38.700 --> 00:42:40.870
The chimera phenomenon unique to twins.

00:42:40.870 --> 00:42:46.910
It occurs when the twins' systems are mixed together across the mother's placenta and a special substance is created.

00:42:47.500 --> 00:42:54.210
I theorized that substance had become special antibodies in Yurie's body and her body was attacking itself.

00:42:55.130 --> 00:42:59.010
Had Yurie and Pinoko been born as twins...

00:42:59.010 --> 00:43:03.800
The special antibodies would likely have killed Yurie at a young age.

00:43:06.850 --> 00:43:08.480
All tumors have been removed.

00:43:08.480 --> 00:43:09.390
How is the time?

00:43:09.390 --> 00:43:10.900
32 minutes have passed.

00:43:10.900 --> 00:43:13.020
Okay, we will now carry out the transplantation.

00:43:13.020 --> 00:43:14.320
R-Right!

00:43:14.320 --> 00:43:16.650
H-He's so fast! I can't believe it!

00:43:17.990 --> 00:43:23.320
However, in Yurie's body there was the teratoid cystoma known as Pinoko.

00:43:24.910 --> 00:43:29.330
Most likely those special antibodies were only compatible with Pinoko.

00:43:30.160 --> 00:43:35.710
In other words, the teratoid cystoma was protecting Yurie from the antibodies' attack.

00:43:36.380 --> 00:43:39.720
In that case, there is only one way to save Yurie.

00:43:40.130 --> 00:43:44.890
That is to put a piece of Pinoko's body back inside Yurie.

00:43:55.980 --> 00:43:57.610
The procedure is complete.

00:43:58.480 --> 00:44:01.110
The time was 59 minutes and 42 seconds.

00:44:01.110 --> 00:44:03.360
Her vitals have stabilized.

00:45:14.140 --> 00:45:20.440
How wonderful! Truly, Lady Yurie is the only one who could dance The Ascent of the White Heron!

00:45:26.990 --> 00:45:28.410
Dr. Black Jack.

00:45:29.870 --> 00:45:33.080
What you said that night... Was it true?

00:45:35.410 --> 00:45:37.540
Is that girl... really alive?

00:45:38.540 --> 00:45:39.130
Yes.

00:45:40.170 --> 00:45:42.550
Where? Where is she?!

00:45:43.380 --> 00:45:44.590
What would you do if you found out?

00:45:45.050 --> 00:45:45.840
I would...!

00:45:45.840 --> 00:45:46.720
This isn't like you!

00:45:48.340 --> 00:45:49.550
This isn't like you.

00:45:50.550 --> 00:45:54.430
You two live in separate worlds now. That isn't going to change.

00:46:03.070 --> 00:46:04.440
Doctor!

00:46:05.690 --> 00:46:08.360
Where'd the doctor go...?

00:46:08.950 --> 00:46:09.950
Wait...!

00:46:11.160 --> 00:46:12.160
Are you...?

00:46:12.660 --> 00:46:17.410
I'm Pinoko! The doctor's wife and super nurse!

00:46:17.960 --> 00:46:20.920
Oh, you must be the Doctor's patient.

00:46:21.670 --> 00:46:24.260
I'm glad you got better.

00:46:25.420 --> 00:46:29.390
If anything else happens, just call the doctor!

00:46:30.800 --> 00:46:33.260
Good bye, Sister.

00:47:00.040 --> 00:47:01.130
Doctor!

00:47:01.500 --> 00:47:04.340
I got a message from Matsunojou!

00:47:04.840 --> 00:47:09.800
The procession is lined with tons of lanterns! There's so many people walking!

00:47:10.260 --> 00:47:12.890
Take a look, see, isn't it amazing?!

00:47:44.920 --> 00:47:49.380
Kaeritsuita machi wa...
The town I returned to...

00:47:51.840 --> 00:47:57.260
Omokage no kakera mo misezu
Wasn't how I remembered it at all.

00:47:58.430 --> 00:48:09.610
Garasu no jouheki ga zutto narande iru dake
There was nothing but glass walls going on forever.

00:48:10.740 --> 00:48:16.530
Matte ite hoshii
I want you to wait for me.

00:48:17.580 --> 00:48:23.420
Ano hi nomikonda tsubuyaki ga
For the whisper I swallowed that day.

00:48:24.420 --> 00:48:30.170
Matte ite hoshii
I want you to wait for me.

00:48:31.170 --> 00:48:39.850
Ima mo azayaka na kizuguchi wo hiraku
Now, the wounds open, still fresh.

00:48:39.850 --> 00:48:46.900
Kousou biru no sukima kara sashikomu tsuki no hikari
The moonlight pokes through the gaps in the highrise buildings.

00:48:46.900 --> 00:48:53.280
Omae mo dareka wo sagashi tsudzukete iru no ka?
Are you still searching for someone too?

00:48:53.280 --> 00:49:00.240
Eien ni kawaranai yasuragi wa tabi no kanata
Unchanging, peace lies at the end of our journey.

00:49:00.240 --> 00:49:05.460
Sora no hate ni shika nokotte inai no ka
Does it only remain beyond the skies?

00:49:08.750 --> 00:49:13.130
But I'll be back again.
But I'll be back again.
